t.","tips":["Aim for a steady edge by move 12: 81% of games get there, and 52% reach +6 by move 23.","Watch your queen: it is behind 24% of your lost leads, 1.3\u00d7 the usual rate, landing on d2, e2, f3.","Aim at their knight: it is behind 27% of their lost leads, 1.4\u00d7 the usual rate, most often the queen's knight (60%). The reply wins it outright 17% of the time. Take it with a pawn.","Material changes hands for you on d5 and d8: build pressure there.","They win material on f3 and d1: keep those squares defended.","Look for the discovered attack: it appears 2.3\u00d7 as often as usual in this opening."],"similar":[],"family":"Zukertort Opening"}